cff-version: 1.2.0

title: EcoLab

message: "If you use EcoLab in your research, please cite this software."

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Simões
    given-names: Ane Carolina
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-6533-0961"

abstract: >
  EcoLab is an open-source desktop application for Species Distribution
  Modeling that integrates biodiversity occurrence records,
  environmental variables, ecological interactions, and machine learning
  into a unified workflow.

repository-code: "https://github.com/EcoToolBox/EcoLab"

url: "https://github.com/EcoToolBox/EcoLab"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - species distribution modeling
  - biodiversity
  - biodiversity informatics
  - ecology
  - machine learning
  - geospatial
  - google earth engine
  - fastapi
  - react
  - python
